    "expectedRule": "Chapter 2 tide order ebb -> flood -> mirror -> ebb. Every first clear of any node advances the tide one step, except the calibration node signal_cache, whose first clear resets the tide to ebb. Display: title 末班潮序, status 退潮/涨潮/镜潮, severity stable/warning/danger, meter {0/1/2, 2}, targetReached only at ebb. Mirror tide scales trap damage and DC by +20% (rounded up); the encounter bonus applies only to the reflection fight, not to ordinary fights. With mist_breathing as the main method every trap is seen through, so a risked trap deals max(4, floor(damage x 0.45)): reflection_fork 24 at mirror -> ceil(28.8) = 29 -> 13; mirror_tide_trap 28 at ebb -> 12. Run pressure stays 0% below 6 clears. Gate metro_ebb_platform_track (tide_boatman -> mirror_tide_trap) opens only at ebb and while closed reads `仅退潮时通行；先到信号箱暗格复位潮序。`; the move is then not a legal destination. The pursuer is a separate run system and is disabled after entry so it cannot ambush the walk. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
